+### Invite a member
+
+1. An owner/admin opens the members page (`entity.members`), which is
+   manager-only server-side.
+2. `Members::sendInvite()` validates and authorizes, rejects addresses that are
+   already members or have a pending invite, rate-limits successful sends, then
+   creates an `entity_invites` row and queues `EntityInviteMail`.
+3. The invitee signs in with the matching e-mail and sees pending invites on the
+   switcher/onboarding. `PendingInvites::accept()` creates the membership with
+   the invited role, marks the invite accepted and selects the tenant;
+   `decline()` deletes the invite.
+
